threads.body:
The comments mention `ctx.name`, but `ParseContext` tracks `databaseName()`/`dbName()`/`namespace()`. Updating these comments to refer to `databaseName` would avoid confusion when maintaining this parser.
```suggestion
    // Note: for jTDS, parseUrl() maps the URL path to the database name
    ctx.parseUrl(jdbcUrl);

    // Handle jTDS/SQL Server-specific parameters
    // For jTDS, the URL path parsed above represents the database name
```

